      <title>作者分析660个会话文件后，成功让AI代理少烧钱</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90660%E4%B8%AA%E4%BC%9A%E8%AF%9D%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8E%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E8%AE%A9AI%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B0%91%E7%83%A7%E9%92%B1/</link>
